"    <div class='table-notes'>"
"    <h2 class='section-advices'>💡 AWStats 性能优化建议</h2>"
"    <ul class='advices-list'>"
"        <li>"
"            <span class='star'>⭐⭐⭐⭐</span> "
"            <b>绝对禁用 DNS 查找</b>：将 DNSLookup 设为 0。需要国家/地区报告时，使用 <b>GeoIP 插件</b>"
